{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/Screenshot_2025-01-14_234135.png?t=1740602848\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The colonies are starving, get out there and harvest some food! Your crew of desperate workers must enter the dangerous environments of the Bio-Cubes (large wildlife reserve cubes), and collect enough food to meet quota. Food is everything in this world, you'll need it to feed the hungry colonists, buy tools and equipment, and keep yourselves alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/ezgif-1f295e304291f7.gif?t=1740602848\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore randomly generated levels, you never know what you'll encounter next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Will the RNG be with or against you?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/ezgif-16512a7e9ee1a5.gif?t=1740602848\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escalating events, harvest what you can and get out before the weather or worse turns on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Was the weather always this bad?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/Screenshot_2025-01-14_233030.png?t=1740602848\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Biomes, each featuring unique mobs, items, traps, events, and decor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Day trips to Toxic Wasteland on sale now!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/Screenshot_2025-01-14_235516.png?t=1740602848\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival of the fittest, from hunted to hunter. Start the game defenseless and only capable of picking some crops. Later acquire weapons and turn the tables on those terrible creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Meat's back on the menu.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/Screenshot_2025-01-14_233856.png?t=1740602848\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wide variety of tools for the job: guns, grenades, garden tools, medieval weapons, even monster parts, whatever gets the job done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A tool for every job.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/Screenshot_2025-02-21_231002.png?t=1740602848\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547430?t=1740602848","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547430?t=1740602848","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/38e977de74cde9808d19fae35dcd94ebc7631af6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740602848","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/38e977de74cde9808d19fae35dcd94ebc7631af6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740602848","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/Screenshot_2025-01-14_234135.png?t=1740602848\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The colonies are starving, get out there and harvest some food! Your crew of desperate workers must enter the dangerous environments of t